   "file": "vo-04.wav",
   "at": 20.569,
   "duration": 4.945979,
   "text": "Tell it once who you sell to and who you're chasing. It fills in the rest."
  },
  {
   "file": "vo-05.wav",
   "at": 28.119,
   "duration": 4.102729,
   "text": "Every morning, it hands you the one thing to do first, and why."
  },
  {
   "file": "vo-06.wav",
   "at": 34.119,
   "duration": 4.180813,
